{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "8d7b87e13f5469cfb6dcdf3b5ee2e490c2a44963574452b33eb20bc196d99dbd", "ja": "小さな旅のはじまり", "zh": "小小旅行的开端", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "997189b57ccf14ae7b370d1f352da6bc25294232692b9581e2b63350d6c631d3", "ja": "地方公演が開催決定、舞台は仙台。目玉の新\n曲は、伊織とエミリーが歌う事に。公演メン\nバーの星梨花の期待も高まる。伊織はプロデ\nューサーに、準備のためにショッピングモー\nルに連れていきなさい、と言うのだった。", "zh": "巡回演出决定举办，舞台定在仙台。作为焦\n点的新曲，将由伊织和艾米莉演唱。同为演\n出成员的星梨花也满怀期待。伊织则对制作\n人说，为了做准备，带我去商场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5279df5629d9957544b60e21e1436074d0ccfbc8257faa0b5c67a3da60bb9ec9", "ja": "（今日は地方公演の初打ち合わせだ。\nさて、みんな揃っているかな？）", "zh": "（今天是地方公演的第一次碰头会。\n那么，大家都到齐了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "490ad91e9ce342a9b5459a2c942704b478d1ae3a2f7c468dfb9a1c3ebd7b85bf", "ja": "伊織さま、先程はありがとうございました！\n稽古での手ほどき、とても勉強になりました。", "zh": "伊织大人，刚才谢谢您了！\n您在排练时的指导，让我受益匪浅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "60a9d74081e0ae1612fbde616fc7660783339a144892f2ec5127d6471fd955d1", "ja": "伊織さんの教え方、とってもわかりやすかったです！\nわたし、もっと練習しなくちゃ……。", "zh": "伊织小姐教得特别清楚！\n我还得更加努力练习才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "827600ce6ef3c79ff7489dfe40e9d53f43e7b1ede431706b385bb1300d7e0690", "ja": "あら、大したことじゃないわ。もし他にも\nわからないところがあったら、質問してちょうだい。", "zh": "哎呀，这没什么大不了的。要是还有\n其他不懂的地方，就尽管来问我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "beaefb3b37e0c6229898046aba591ca8f3e630c58c456f58063e03466348a307", "ja": "この伊織ちゃんが、完璧な\nアドバイスをしてあげるんだから！　にひひっ。", "zh": "由本伊织来给你最完美的建议！嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3aaedc277386f0e90a2f276a27a80c9968bdb9b52c44cee5939fc31e7eb3682d", "ja": "お待たせ、エミリー、伊織。\nお、星梨花も一緒だったのか。", "zh": "让你们久等了，艾米莉、伊织。\n哦，星梨花也和你们一起啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "46e1c58d3f4de69bc5fb0f994459b09931d66c58c49707766d01a07731072080", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n今日は、みんな一緒のレッスンだったんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n今天大家一起上了练习课。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "3c0143a3309726e406731da49de2e286c9d70c38b4b8c6f383f51f4df5b29648", "ja": "伊織さんとエミリーちゃんは、これからお仕事の\nお話だって……あっ！　わたし、お邪魔ですよね？", "zh": "伊织小姐和艾米莉接下来要谈工作……啊！我是不是打扰到你们了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "e5e74ae532093e80922028fd10b3ad5da753394fd869b8cc207fa7200e083bcc", "ja": "気にすることないわ。ねえ{$P$}、\n星梨花が聞いても、かまわない話なんでしょ？", "zh": "不用在意。对吧，{$P$}，就算星梨花听到了，也没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4bc1046a4b2d5195cb0ece7518acda647d096efaa5d8173af4821466b548623c", "ja": "ああ、問題ないよ。\nというか、星梨花にも少し関係あるからな。", "zh": "啊，没问题。\n不如说，这也和星梨花有点关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "561405aedee066f60dd9e0d30b83e2ae25c397fa3a85b88559f8a3deed16aa5d", "ja": "わたしにも、ですか？", "zh": "也和我有关吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "87f5249cc88923db6664edef772b514e564e0029c8496fb9483e9dad071d8c2a", "ja": "それじゃ、改めて。\n伊織とエミリーに仕事なんだけど……。", "zh": "那么，重新来说。\n有份工作要交给伊织和艾米莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "0d788cacf96f428c7612e2eeb55ad46fac8f5a0172a868248f8dca07959fc069", "ja": "地方公演！", "zh": "地方公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "0d788cacf96f428c7612e2eeb55ad46fac8f5a0172a868248f8dca07959fc069", "ja": "地方公演！", "zh": "地方公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "0d788cacf96f428c7612e2eeb55ad46fac8f5a0172a868248f8dca07959fc069", "ja": "地方公演！", "zh": "地方公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "fb47d4c26d1eb2a242863a190232d1623a33346419905cfdceca7e8ac42e0d40", "ja": "地方公演、いいじゃない♪　私としては、\nロサンゼルスなんかいいと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "地方巡演，挺不错的嘛♪　依我看，\n洛杉矶之类的就挺好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "7ee113da747254e07a62cab3922f8c6055f62494caef7a49416777796968aed4", "ja": "私は……京都に行きたいです！\n金閣寺に三十三間堂……どれも美しいです♪", "zh": "我……想去京都！\n金阁寺、三十三间堂……每一处都美不胜收♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "ae9b3507f470128380c7eb310872ca476314cf7660f910d9d8dda5f6530aae8b", "ja": "あら、いいじゃない。金閣寺を貸し切って\nライブできたら、話題になるんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，挺不错的嘛。要是能把金阁寺包下来\n办演唱会，肯定会很有话题度吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2211ac7704f39df327db1efab8232e318258ec8c491d570c1e43f74ad8eeea04", "ja": "いや、文化財でのライブは少し厳しいかな……。\nその前に、候補地がいくつかあるんだ。", "zh": "不，在文化遗产办演出还是有点难的吧……\n在此之前，已经有几个候选地点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "57b040041947305c08963adc541fdd8c6294a245848fd65b04a26d74114fff15", "ja": "何よ、ケチケチしちゃって。だいたい、\n候補を決めてあるなら、最初から言いなさいよね！", "zh": "干什么呀，这么小气。既然大致已经决定好候选地点了，就该一开始说出来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9cd6587ef68c5ab1207bc11d5a6a62a8ab6221a58e417502e8322b5d4f190b09", "ja": "すまない……。\nええと、今回の公演は仙台を考えているんだ。", "zh": "抱歉……  \n呃，这次的公演，我考虑的是仙台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "9b692624e7ab1412b971a41daa85dfd8e5182ef798806690becbfff453f0e14c", "ja": "Wow！　仙台といえば、伊達政宗公の土地ですね？\nとても素敵だと思います♪", "zh": "哇！说到仙台，那就是伊达政宗公的属地对吧？\n我觉得非常棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "a11ec201f664bf3b08ecbb8aeac8023c99eae961f618ba234609b206e2bb7e62", "ja": "仙台ね。思ったより近いけど、いいんじゃない？\nおいしい牛タンが食べられるお店なら知ってるわよ。", "zh": "仙台吗？比想象中近，不过也不错嘛。要是能吃到美味牛舌的店，我倒是知道一家哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "cf40cd8d7bb4c5dd071086a8b73c9757d9f00dbc2dcc23a224cf0346d80e9229", "ja": "それと……公演の目玉になる新曲は、\n伊織とエミリーに歌ってもらおうと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "另外……我打算让伊织和艾米莉演唱作为公演亮点的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "5c2adf014ac54ea749f7f1e5cce5e232aa9ce9129e2eb2d93974792bb3d508e5", "ja": "えっ？\nわ、私が、伊織さまと……ですか！？", "zh": "诶？\n我、我要和伊织大人……一起唱吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "054ca3b4a1dff2d215cd5fe9c7dd6e4a4878b75e3aa32c45dcd0b3f7cdf7e30f", "ja": "そう、わかったわ。エミリー、よろしくね。\nあんまり気負わないで、楽しんでやりましょう！", "zh": "好，知道了。艾米莉，请多关照。\n别太紧张，开心地做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "b54c01d9e61e85c5e1f83b84d641d28b7dbd8424ddac28335e55dfdfb5c883a0", "ja": "楽しんで……は、はいっ！\n私、がんばります……！", "zh": "享受其中……好、好的！\n我会努力的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "fb6699d03a578d827855a8e1e34c3810a5969789d8d516a65ab75d1c72c596b6", "ja": "わぁ、伊織さんとエミリーちゃんのデュオですか？\nどんな曲なんだろう……。", "zh": "哇，是伊织小姐和艾米莉的小组对唱吗？\n会是什么样的歌曲呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b208c498b1074002ebd6c1dc68774bbb3cffb44f3e697b4a32d147b0f2331429", "ja": "公演には、星梨花にも出演してもらおうと\n思ってるんだ。あとのメンバーは、春香と雪歩だ。", "zh": "我想让星梨花也参加演出。其他成员是春香和雪歩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1030_022ser", "source_sha256": "dadce4b60ce0a8d764bb24bfd03ddc903606dcc897e4b9080ff088efe8206fac", "ja": "わたしも、出演していいんですか？　わぁ……♪\nわかりました、がんばります！", "zh": "我也能出演吗？哇啊……♪\n我知道了，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1031_007ior", "source_sha256": "b032331439b4abb79eb5543f1488b9d372d8d03705cc147290b492d2f0058591", "ja": "そういうことなら……\n必要なのは、コレよね♪", "zh": "既然这样的话……\n需要的就是这个吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "294ca2901c0a14657145ee43b8f37eadbd9ccdd7ea9db6b0f5b34736ec459a61", "ja": "伊織さま、それは……先日、莉緒さんが\n美肌の湯を調べていらした、旅行雑誌ですね？", "zh": "伊织大人，那是……前几天莉绪小姐查阅的美容温泉旅行杂志吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1033_007ior", "source_sha256": "a9dd57ed5e671bace3b26664a2c0256b351782bdc94cbc2587ded8f0d2f4d86a", "ja": "ええ、そうよ。全国版だから、\n仙台についても載ってるはず……ほら！", "zh": "是的，就是那本。因为是全国版，应该也会刊登仙台的内容……你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_01_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "54b9c213c1ec117ed23ac84bff906787b2000a558479d6c7b12107022cf27a70", "ja": "仙台の人気観光地や飲食店が紹介されていますね！\nまぁ、どうしましょう……♪", "zh": "上面介绍了仙台的人气观光地和餐饮店呢！\n哎呀，该怎么办才好……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
